# A woodcutter placed with no flag standing puts its flag down on the node south-east of it, and a road from the castle's
# flag reaches that flag. play/first-loop.play covers the log that comes home along such a road.
# Run it on the game view with seed 1234567812345678 and size 1:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh hut-flag --game-view --seed 1234567812345678 --size 1 --fps 10
# On that map the castle stands at 21,4, so its flag is at 22,5. The woodcutter goes to 26,4, its flag to 27,5.
expect seed = 1234567812345678
expect size = 1
wait 0.3
click-tile 21 4
wait 0.3

button Woodcutter
click-tile 26 4
button Woodcutter
wait 0.3
expect-at 26 4 building
expect-at 27 5 flag
shot placed 26 4 1 2

button Road
click-tile 22 5
click-tile 23 5
click-tile 24 5
click-tile 25 5
click-tile 26 5
click-tile 27 5
button Road
wait 0.3
expect-at 25 5 road
shot road
